OL,3,GNEWSAProxy voting to be considered for
OL,4,Aislanders
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople could be allowed to vote by
OL,7,Fproxy in Sark's next general election
OL,8,Fif an upcoming proposal goes ahead.
OL,10,FThe island's Chief Pleas will be asked
OL,11,Fto consider the idea put forward by the
OL,12,FPolicy and Finance Committee at its
OL,13,FMichaelmas Meeting on 30 September.
OL,15,FIf given the green light, those unable
OL,16,Fto attend the polling station in person
OL,17,Fbecause of illness, injury, disability
OL,18,For unavoidable absence, would be able
OL,19,Fto appoint someone else to cast a vote
OL,20,Fon their behalf.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
