OL,3,GNEWSAProxy voting to be considered for
OL,4,Aislanders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe committee said its proposal had
OL,7,Fbeen developed with the island's
OL,8,Freturning officer with the hope it
OL,9,Fcould be introduced in time for the
OL,10,Felection on 25 November.
